Recommends:
 gstreamer1.0-pulseaudio | gstreamer1.0-alsa
Description: audio player for The Lunduke Computer Operating System
 EarBlaster is a single-window gtkmm-3 audio player in the Windows Media
 Player 7 shape. Local files only, one LCOS-flavoured skin, no video.
 Playback uses GStreamer playbin (MP3, Ogg, FLAC, WAV, M4A).
